  "description": "Born with a limitation that prevents his mana from growing any further, the elf Lifrill storms into a dragon’s lair in search of reawakening—only to fall straight into the clutches of the middle-aged dragon Alberion Hawey.\nIn his desperate attempt to obtain a single sip of dragon’s blood for his reawakening, Lifrill endures all kinds of exploitation at Alberion’s hands. And at the very end of it, with the dragon’s blood he barely manages to obtain, he finally attempts his reawakening…\nA chaotic, explosive romantic comedy about the half-elf wanderer Lifrill and the middle-aged dragon Alberion Hawey!\n\n(Source: RIDI, translated)",
